


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_54158645:


    "晚饭后的闲暇时光。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_a13a0b4b:


    "伦趴在地上读书，阳菜枕在伦的腰上摆弄相机。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_52726d34:



    voice "2RI_0929"
    rin "「呃」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_a671aa13:



    voice "2HI_0957"
    hina "「嗯？重吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_3ce797e0:



    voice "2RI_0930"
    rin "「呀，被项圈的金属扎到了，有点痛」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_ba5cac7f:



    voice "2HI_0958"
    hina "「哇，抱歉」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_c2f9a27e:


    "阳菜起身离开伦的背部。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_d18495e2:



    voice "2RI_0931"
    rin "「看你一直戴着它，不会厌吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_5f4e75c8:



    voice "2HI_0959"
    hina "「完全不会」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_316e489f:


    "阳菜把脖子上的项圈转了一下，改变了金属的位置。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_152ebbf4:



    voice "2RI_0932"
    rin "「别让其他人看到了啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_3e44cbe8:



    voice "2HI_0960"
    hina "「这话该我和伦说才对吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_12a2ac5b:



    voice "2RI_0933"
    rin "「什么意思？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_062150cc:



    voice "2HI_0961"
    hina "「正月到我家留宿的时候，你把它落在洗脸台上了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_ddd1aed4:



    voice "2RI_0934"
    rin "「咦，是这么回事吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_e79c05b2:



    voice "2HI_0962"
    hina "「有啊。被妈妈看到了我还很着急的。我说是浅生家的亚瑟的项圈蒙混过去了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_8f57328c:



    voice "2RI_0935"
    rin "「……抱歉」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_b9c80bb8:



    voice "2HI_0963"
    hina "「伦太不爱惜这个项圈了。我真的担心你会弄丢它」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_c2c84e62:



    voice "2RI_0936"
    rin "「我最开始就说了啊，我丢三落四可能会弄丢的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_cc4279d3:



    voice "2HI_0964"
    hina "「所以你就多注意一下啊！这个东西对我们俩来说很重要诶！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_0910bc28:



    voice "2RI_0937"
    rin "「果然还是阳菜来保管——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_76b09c22:



    voice "2HI_0965"
    hina "「唔唔唔唔！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_576d74ef:



    voice "2RI_0938"
    rin "「你生什么气嘛。这是我送给你的礼物，本来就是阳菜的东西了嘛？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_528009d1:


    "阳菜和伦对于“东西”的看法似乎不太一样。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_6c36fc96:


    "伦是单纯地把“东西”当做“东西”。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_5cd682db:


    "但对阳菜来说，“东西”是“心意”的具象化。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_36fa9315:


    "“东西”自身也很重要，但与回忆、约定相关的“东西”凝聚了心意，所以最为重要。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_8142ab87:


    "比如说这个项圈——"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_8167c8cf:



    voice "2HI_0966"
    hina "「这个项圈是“我是伦的所有物”的证明啊！希望伦能把它当做我好好珍惜保管」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_3aa13136:



    voice "2RI_0939"
    rin "「好沉重……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_a32f1200:



    voice "2HI_0967"
    hina "「诶，我果然还是太重了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_2f81a39f:


    "阳菜并没有听懂。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_d396de2d:


    "伦放下书，站起身。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_96f7f297:



    voice "2HI_0968"
    hina "「你要去哪？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_62830a15:



    voice "2RI_0940"
    rin "「洗手间」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_5b1942eb:



    voice "2HI_0969"
    hina "「那我也去」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_46323e9d:



    voice "2RI_0941"
    rin "「这么冷就别跟过来了吧。这下真搞不清到底是谁被项圈给锁住了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_0f76c521:



    voice "2HI_0970"
    hina "「我要不要减肥啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_dcc777ad:


    "伦出门后，阳菜瞅着门，片刻后，她才回头。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_cdb05634:



    voice "2MI_0861"
    miyako "「我觉得阳菜同学不胖哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_b86aad88:


    "这位同学也没听懂。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_c2748ea4:



    voice "2HI_0971"
    hina "「但伦说我重啊。要不和浅生一起开始节食好了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_7ecfaff8:



    voice "2FU_0800"
    fumi "「唔咕！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_74daa5ab:


    "节食中的文被不幸误伤。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_693fc310:


    "但是，此刻正打算偷吃曲奇的文也并不无辜。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_4bbc0994:



    voice "2FU_0801"
    fumi "「咳咳……那个」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_7c312d34:


    "文重整气势（以及把曲奇放回盘里），和阳菜说道。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_b8bec1c4:



    voice "2FU_0802"
    fumi "「绪方同学说的“重”，不是体重而是心意」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_f182dad8:



    voice "2HI_0972"
    hina "「心意？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_504c1cb1:



    voice "2FU_0803"
    fumi "「呃……比如心意太沉重让对方感到负担之类的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_3abe73a3:


    "文谨慎地筛选着措辞，然而——"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_a75078e5:



    voice "2HI_0973"
    hina "「负担……我给伦添麻烦了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_5ed35933:


    "阳菜立马泪眼汪汪。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_43fd2a50:



    voice "2FU_0804"
    fumi "「不不不！不是添麻烦，呃……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_0e35082d:



    voice "2MI_0862"
    miyako "「就像是夏目同学的私人空间比较窄，但绪方同学比较宽这样吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_f0da0c0d:


    "私人空间，换言之就是“与他人保持的距离”。相当于每个人与他人建交时，在心中筑起围墙画出的领地。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_2179fdb6:



    voice "2FU_0805"
    fumi "「就是这个！每个人对独处的需求和束缚的感觉都不一样而已！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_2bd13dcb:


    "文拼命抓住了圣夜子递出的救命稻草。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_ecc7507f:



    voice "2HI_0974"
    hina "「这个我大概能理解。因为去年的伦我也见过了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_87bc84bc:



    voice "2MI_0863"
    miyako "「“我不喜欢集体生活”」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_ef527243:


    "突然模仿起伦。不过不像。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_bae6c0db:



    voice "2HI_0975"
    hina "「啊哈哈，就是这个！你很喜欢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_f3c5e791:



    voice "2MI_0864"
    miyako "「是的。啊，但要对伦保密」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_a7c55d56:


    "阳菜的心情好转了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_0951f9c9:



    voice "2HI_0976"
    hina "「一直缠着她是不是有点烦人啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_1fb1cf61:



    voice "2FU_0806"
    fumi "「你们才交往没多久呀。来日方长，一点点把握适合彼此的距离吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_730debe2:



    voice "2HI_0977"
    hina "「谢谢，我不想被当做是沉重的人」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_a5746966:



    voice "2FU_0807"
    fumi "「但也不要自己一个人憋在心里哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_c04f3904:



    voice "2HI_0978"
    hina "「嗯。但我不想被伦讨厌。会努力不去缠着她的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_c1a53a07:



    voice "2FU_0808"
    fumi "「……夏目同学」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_2d92a4d9:



    voice "2MI_0865"
    miyako "「掉了……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_794c2579:



    voice "2FU_0809"
    fumi "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_01_6f0841aa:


    "是曲奇。"
